<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill explains cement co cuts.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill explains cement co cuts.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch analyst Jon Goldfarb said he downgraded six cement companies due to their stock prices.</p>
<p>-- said the stocks &quot;still represent attractive value, and are likely to move higher.&quot;</p>
<p>-- the companies include Centex Construction Products Inc, Giant Cement Holding Inc, Lafarge Corp, Lone Star Industries Inc, Southdown Inc, and Medusa Corp.</p>
</text>
